# opencode Skill Redirect

This file redirects opencode to the actual skill location in `.agents/skills/`.

**Actual skill path:** `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/`

## Usage

The skill is loaded from `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/` which contains:
- `SKILL.md` — Main skill definition
- `scripts/search.py` — Design system generator
- `data/` — Searchable databases (styles, colors, fonts, charts, products, UX guidelines)
- `references/` — Quick reference and pro rules

## Loading the Skill

In opencode, the skill will be available as `ui-ux-pro-max` and can be invoked via:
- Automatic activation when UI/UX tasks are detected
- Explicit skill tool: `skill("ui-ux-pro-max")`

## Key Commands

```bash
# Generate design system (run from project root)
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "saas dashboard minimal tech" --design-system --persist -p "Leads CRM"

# Generate with page override
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "saas dashboard minimal tech" --design-system --persist -p "Leads CRM" --page "kanban"
```

